---
import { ArrowRight } from '@lucide/astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="Now" active="Now">
  <section class="shell page-intro"><span class="eyebrow"><i class="status-dot"></i> Updated 26 October 2026</span><h1>What has my attention<span>.</span></h1><p>The work, questions, and experiments I'm spending time on.</p></section>
  <section class="shell now-layout"><div class="now-main"><article class="focus-item"><span class="focus-number">01</span><div><span class="eyebrow">At work</span><h2>Making data useful.</h2><p>Technical definition for data and reporting: connecting business needs to architecture, data contracts, and delivery. I also use and extend agent-assisted workflows for specification, implementation, and review.</p></div></article><article class="focus-item"><span class="focus-number">02</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Live product</span><h2>Pulpo, from decisions to operation.</h2><p>Recent work connects mobile onboarding, a production-session correction, and a sixteen-trial workflow comparison. I directed and reviewed the work; agents implemented and executed it. The next questions concern human content validation and review effort.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('work/pulpo-oposiciones/')}>The case study <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div></article><article class="focus-item"><span class="focus-number">03</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Local prototype</span><h2>Evidence before financial action.</h2><p>The invoice-reconciliation investigator connects source records, proposed allocations, and human approval. A small reviewed comparison is complete; broader validation, reviewer timing, and cloud operation remain ahead.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('work/invoice-reconciliation/')}>The prototype <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div></article><article class="focus-item"><span class="focus-number">04</span><div><span class="eyebrow">Delivery experiment</span><h2>When does coordination earn its cost?</h2><p>AI Product Delivery has a first local discovery slice. I'm exploring persistent requirements and inspectable evidence, with accepted outcomes and total human effort as the measures that matter.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('work/ai-product-delivery/')}>The workbench <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></a></div></article></div><aside class="now-aside"><span class="eyebrow">A small commitment</span><h2>Leave a record<br />of the work.</h2><p>Build something. Examine the result. Write down what changed.</p><div class="next-entry"><span class="eyebrow">Next to investigate</span><p>How to measure review effort alongside completed, accepted outcomes.</p></div><a class="text-link" href={url('notes/')}>Read the field notes <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></a></aside></section>
</Base>
